Subject: [PATCH] Only let department members load or change data

Every data route now checks the signed-in email against the Deli
department list on the server. People who are not on the list get a
403 instead of the data, so removing someone on the Access tab takes
effect right away. Import is limited to owners because it replaces
all data.

